            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode berikut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Contact\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  first = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  last = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Doe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cell = \" /><text value=\"&quot;3112445656&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  email = \" /><text value=\"&quot;jdoe@gmail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_cell\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(self.cell)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Method <code>get_cell</code> perlu diberi indentasi </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Method <code>get_cell</code> tidak boleh memiliki parameter apa pun</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak dapat menggunakan fungsi print dalam method class</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Method <code>get_cell</code> perlu diberi indentasi .</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah program membuat <code>Contact</code> dan mencoba memanggil <code>get_cell</code> padanya. Mengapa <code>get_cell</code> bukan method class ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Contact\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  first = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  last = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Doe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cell = \" /><text value=\"&quot;3112445656&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  email = \" /><text value=\"&quot;jdoe@gmail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_cell\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(self.cell)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Definisinya harus diindentasi di dalam <code>Contact</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Method class tidak dapat menerima <code>self</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Method class tidak dapat memanggil <code>print()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Definisinya harus diindentasi di dalam <code>Contact</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
